msgstr "Unavailable"

msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Checking..."

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Actions"

msgid "Low"
msgstr "Low"

msgid "These options do not apply while Streaming only is enabled. Turn it off to choose a playback memory profile and apply changes."
msgstr "These options do not apply while Streaming only is enabled. Turn it off to choose a playback memory profile and apply changes."

msgid "Mimics official clients’ streaming behavior with lower memory usage. Skips the playback cache and its protection against network interruptions: QBZ’s cache keeps upcoming audio ready for more reliable playback and instant replay."
msgstr "Mimics official clients’ streaming behavior with lower memory usage. Skips the playback cache and its protection against network interruptions: QBZ’s cache keeps upcoming audio ready for more reliable playback and instant replay."

